# HOW TO DEVELOP THIS FILE
# Purpose: keeps files that must never be committed out of this repo.
# Edit it when: a new tool creates files you should not commit (editor folders, build output, local notes).
# How: add one pattern per line; check with `git status` that the file now disappears; never remove the .env lines.
# Note: this is the kit's own .gitignore. template/.gitignore.pipeline is a different file: the lines the
#       installer appends to a user's project.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
